  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PODER: Program for occupational inclusion, defense of the right  to education and claim of the rights of Persons with Disabilities</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">PODER: programma per l&#x2019;inclusione occupazionale, difesa del diritto all&#x2019;educazione e rivendicazione dei diritti delle Persone Con Disabilit&#xe0;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">L&#x2019;iniziativa mira a promuovere la piena inclusione educativa e sociale delle Persone Con Disabilit&#xe0; in El Salvador in conformit&#xe0; con la Ley Especial de Inclusi&#xf2;n de Personas con Discapacidad e con la UNCRPD. In particolare, il progetto contribuisce a far s&#xec; che le Persone Con Disabilit&#xe0; rappresentino soggetti attivi di processi di inclusione educativa e sociale secondo standard definiti e monitorabili, nelle quattro zone target di progetto.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiative aims to promote the full educational and social inclusion of Persons with Disabilities in El Salvador in accordance with the Special Law on Inclusion of Persons with Disabilities and the UNCRPD. In particular, the project contributes to ensuring that Persons with Disabilities are active subjects of educational and social inclusion processes according to defined and monitorable standards, in the four project target areas. Among the main objectives of the project is the increase in female leadership in management roles</narrative>
  </description>
